              "text": "A street corner? (まちかど, machikado.) Within the city? (しない, shinai.) The suburbs? (こうがい, kougai.) The opposite side? (はんたいがわ, hantaigawa.) Upstream? (かわかみ, kawakami.) This? (この, kono.) That? (あの, ano.) Which? (どの, dono.) This kind of? (こんな, konna.) That kind of? (あんな, anna.) What kind of? (どんな, donna.) Other? (ほか, hoka.) Everybody? (みんな, minna.) This sort of? (こういう, kouiu.) That sort of? (ああいう, aaiu.) To hit? (うつ, utsu.) To breathe in? (すう, suu.) To sow; to wind? (まく, maku.) To cook? (たく, taku.) To put on? (はく, haku.) To bloom? (さく, saku.) To solve? (とく, toku.) To hold in one's arms? (だく, daku.) To step on? (ふむ, fumu.) To bite? (かむ, kamu.)"
